# Project core

- Prefer small, focused diffs. Do not invent endpoints absent from OpenAPI.
- Core (`internal/core`) must not import Gin, GORM, Redis, or Watermill.
- After OpenAPI/`paths/` changes: `make contracts` then `make routes`.
- Never hand-edit `routes_gen.go`.
- Markdown: relative links only; validate with `scripts/docs/validate_relative_links.cjs`.
- Read `AGENTS.md` for commands. Security/testing/deploy ops: `docs/security/`, `docs/testing/`, `docs/deployment/`.
